        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-307",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "│   (Direct tool calling)                 │"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-308",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "└─────────────────────────────────────────┘"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-309",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "My Answer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-310",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Don't build MCP yet. Don't build a chat interface."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-311",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Do this:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-312",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ship markdown prompts with filegraph init"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-313",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Document IDE integration for Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-314",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let agents read the prompts - they already know how"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-315",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Add MCP later if users demand it"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-316",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The beauty: Markdown files are:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-317",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Zero setup"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-318",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Universal (work in all IDEs)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-319",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Human-readable docs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-320",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Git-friendly"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-321",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Easy to customize"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-322",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Easy to share"
        }
      ]
    },
